{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/http/15_HTTPS/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1 id=\"05-보안\" style=\"position:relative;\">05. 보안<a href=\"#05-%EB%B3%B4%EC%95%88\" aria-label=\"05 보안 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://github.com/jeonghwan-kim/lecture-http\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/jeonghwan-kim/lecture-http</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://jeonghwan-kim.github.io/2024/07/11/lecture-http-part5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://jeonghwan-kim.github.io/2024/07/11/lecture-http-part5</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>브라우저 보안과 함께 HTTP 통신을 더 안전하게 만드는 LTS</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>13장. 브라우저 보안</p>\n<ul>\n<li>XSS (크로스 사이트 스크립팅)와 같은 공격 기법과 이를 방지하기 위한 브라우저 보안정책</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>14장. CORS</p>\n<ul>\n<li>외부 도메인의 자원을 안전하게 활용하기 위한 CORS 정책과 적용 방법</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>15장. HTTPS</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTPS가 네트워크 보안을 강화하는 방식과 TLS의 역할</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"15장-https\" style=\"position:relative;\">15장. HTTPS<a href=\"#15%EC%9E%A5-https\" aria-label=\"15장 https permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"15-1-해시\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-1. 해시<a href=\"#15-1-%ED%95%B4%EC%8B%9C\" aria-label=\"15 1 해시 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>해시함수</li>\n<li>해시 값(다이제스트) 특징: 고정 길이, 고유성, 변경 불가, 단방향</li>\n<li>대표적인 해시 함수: MD5</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"15-2-암호화\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-2. 암호화<a href=\"#15-2-%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94\" aria-label=\"15 2 암호화 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>해시 함수의 한계\n<ul>\n<li>복호화 불가: 변경한 값을 원래 값으로 복구할 수 없음</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>특징: 암호화, 복호화, 키\n<ul>\n<li>암호화 키와 복호화 키가 같으면 ‘대칭키 암호화’</li>\n<li>암호화 키와 복호화 키가 다르면 ‘비대칭키 암호화’</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>대표적인 암호화 알고리즘: AES</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"15-3-비대칭키-암호화\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-3. 비대칭키 암호화<a href=\"#15-3-%EB%B9%84%EB%8C%80%EC%B9%AD%ED%82%A4-%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94\" aria-label=\"15 3 비대칭키 암호화 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>대칭키 암호화의 한계\n<ul>\n<li>키 관리가 어려움</li>\n<li>무결성 부족</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>특징: 서로 다른 키, 공개키(암호화 할 때 사용), 개인키(복호화 할 때 사용), 신분 증명</li>\n<li>비대칭 키의 대표적인 알고리즘: RSA</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 개인키 생성</span>\r\n$ openssl genpkey <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-algorithm</span> RSA <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-out</span> private_key.pem\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 공개키 생성</span>\r\n$ openssl rsa <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-putout</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-in</span> private_key.pem <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-out</span> public_key.pem\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 공개키로 암호화</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Hello World\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> openssl rsautl <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-encrypt</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-inkey</span> public_key.pem <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-pubin</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-out</span> encrypted\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 개인키로 복호화</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> encrypted <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> openssl rsautl <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-decrypt</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-inkey</span> private_key.pem</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>암호화 방식 비교: 해시 함수, 대칭키 암호화, 비대칭키 암호화</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"15-4-디지털-서명\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-4. 디지털 서명<a href=\"#15-4-%EB%94%94%EC%A7%80%ED%84%B8-%EC%84%9C%EB%AA%85\" aria-label=\"15 4 디지털 서명 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>디지털 서명의 원리: 해시 함수 사용, 개인키로 서명, 평문과 서명 전달, 서명의 유효성 검증\n<ul>\n<li>A: 평문 데이터로 해시값 생성 -> 개인키를 만들어 복호함수에 전달 -> 서명</li>\n<li>평문과 서명을 B에 전달</li>\n<li>B: 평문 데이터로 해시값 생성 -> 전달 받은 서명을 전달 받은 공개키를 이용해 암호함수에 전달 -> 결과물</li>\n<li>결과물이 해시값과 같은지 체크</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>디지털 서명 실습</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 평문 생성</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"It's me\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">></span> message.txt\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># md5로 해시값 생성</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> message.txt <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> md5 <span class=\"token operator\">></span> message.md5\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 서명 파일 제작</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> message.md5 <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> openssl <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-dgst</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-md5</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-sign</span> private_key.pem <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-out</span> message.sig\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 평문과 서명 파일 B에게 전달</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 검증</span>\r\n$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> message.md5 <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> openssl dgst <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-md5</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-verify</span> public_key.pem <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-signiture</span> message.sig</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"15-5-디지털-인증서\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-5. 디지털 인증서<a href=\"#15-5-%EB%94%94%EC%A7%80%ED%84%B8-%EC%9D%B8%EC%A6%9D%EC%84%9C\" aria-label=\"15 5 디지털 인증서 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>디지털 인증서 원리</li>\n<li>디지털 인증서 사례</li>\n</ul>\n<p>디지털 인증서: 신뢰할 수 있는 기관이 인터넷상에서 사용자의 신원을 보증하는 문서</p>\n<ul>\n<li>사용자 이름</li>\n<li>유효 기간</li>\n<li>발급자 정보</li>\n<li>디지털 서명</li>\n<li>공개키</li>\n</ul>\n<p>대부분의 디지털 인증서는 x.509라는 표준 형식을 따른다.<br>\n이 형식은 공통적으로 사용되는 인증서의 구조를 규정한다.</p>\n<p>구글의 사례를 살펴본다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># HTTPS, TLS 서버에 연결을 시도</span>\r\n$ openssl s_client <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-connect</span> www.google.com:443 <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-servername</span> google.com <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>/dev/null<span class=\"token operator\">></span> google.crt</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>google.crt 파일이 다운로드 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 출력값</span>\r\nConnecting to <span class=\"token number\">142.250</span>.76.132\r\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">depth</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">C</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>US, <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">O</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>Google Trust Services LLC, <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">CN</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>GTS Root R4\r\nverify return:1\r\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">depth</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">C</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>US, <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">O</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>Google Trust Services, <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">CN</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>WE2\r\nverify return:1\r\n<span class=\"token assign-left variable\">depth</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">CN</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>*.google.com\r\nverify return:1\r\nDONE</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> google.crt</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>다운로드 한 인증서 내용을 확인할 때도 OpenSSL을 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">$ openssl x509 <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-in</span> google.crt <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-text</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-noout</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"15-6-tls\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-6. TLS<a href=\"#15-6-tls\" aria-label=\"15 6 tls permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>1단계: TLS 핸드쉐이크</li>\n<li>2단계: 데이터 전송</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"15-7-https-서버-제작\" style=\"position:relative;\">15-7. HTTPS 서버 제작<a href=\"#15-7-https-%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84-%EC%A0%9C%EC%9E%91\" aria-label=\"15 7 https 서버 제작 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>디지털 인증서 생성</li>\n<li>인증서로 HTTPS 서버 제작</li>\n</ul>\n<p>curl로 구글 사이트에 요청을 보내본다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">$ <span class=\"token function\">curl</span> https://google.com <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 결과값</span>\r\n* Host google.com:443 was resolved. <span class=\"token comment\"># 433번 포트로 접속 시도</span>\r\n* IPv6: <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>none<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n* IPv4: <span class=\"token nu